    "boundary": "Minimal unit/stat/Holy Shield stubs; no actual Holy Shield/inventory/override/event dispatch, modern binary or map behavior.180 base-immunity cases and20 signed-defense cases pass. Reduction reads base stat, not already-reduced current total. Defense is basis+basis*percent/100, truncating signed product separately; basis1 at-49 remains1."
  },
  "mechanics": "Separate hostile leases, source effective rank, delayed free right-slot aura and supplier zero-stat marker. Fixed source radius20 projects to10 native tiles. Fire/cold/lightning deltas snapshot each pulse; poison/magic/physical unchanged. Negative monster immunity modifiers use one-fifth based on underlying pre-debuff native resistance, excluding known legacy Conviction offsets and friendly resistance aura additions; players/native BaseHire proxy are full effect. Lower Resist receives the same original immunity baseline, caps deferred until after independent deltas, then Cold Mastery/item pierce and player maximum caps apply. Ordinary pierce never breaks a remaining monster immunity. Negative skill armor percentage adds to Defiance/cold-armor defense percentage with signed integer operation order. Supplier rank strictly greater than incoming protects itself, not allies/pets. Weaker hostile ranks do not refresh stronger lists; equal ranks refresh while retaining source.",
  "eliteBridge": "Native legacy elite Conviction resistance mods are stripped before managed class calculations; strongest eligible class/elite rank applies once. Higher native elite supplier rejects weaker player aura. A stronger player supplier ignores lower elite penalties in typed damage. Existing legacy-only range/cadence/projection remains unchanged; no global elite rewrite or new native patch.",
  "persistence": "Generic priority126 v0 hostile source/rank/defense/three resistance snapshots/deadlines; supplier marker/emitter remains in existing121 JSON v0. Target death/expiry prunes hostile leases; source selection/death does not prematurely clear remaining target duration. Focused three boots/two actual reloads passed with resumed pulse recalculation and expiry.",
  "nativeCoverage": [
    "Quoted pinned formulas, rank1/20 signed defense/resists, rank25/26 cap, fixed radius boundary, right/self/delayed/free selection",
    "Supplier/friend/player/controlled pet exclusions and real hostile NPC recipient",
    "Native AOS fire damage at75 resistance; independent Lower Resist changes100->63 fire and130->93 lightning, then item pierce93->86",
    "Poison/magic/physical exclusions, remaining105 lightning immunity unaffected by ordinary pierce500",
